      "position": 1,
      "text": "Gather all ingredients."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Stir apples, almonds, cranberries, cherries and yogurt together in a salad bowl until evenly coated."
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!"
    }
